{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1160026-spells-for-magically-storing-items","id":1160026,"title":"Spells for Magically Storing Items?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-17T15:29:46-08:00","id":1160026,"title":"Spells for Magically Storing Items?","content":"Hello, I am a newly awakened Moros Mysterium mage looking for a way to store items magically. For example, I want to put a sword through a small dimension/void and later when I need it, I can pull it out of thin air again. The closest thing I can find is Touch of the Grave (Death 2, page 130,) but it never mentions putting or storing anything through it. My best friend pointed out another one - a Space 5 one called Pocket Dimension, but it's apparently for places and far too large. So what can I do? Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":22337,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/22337-overcastghost","user":"OvercastGhost","date":". 11-17-2017, 06:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/22337-overcastghost","name":"OvercastGhost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar22337_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T15:50:29-08:00","id":1160027,"title":"","content":"Space can also be used to enlarge the space inside a container such as a pocket.<br /> <br /> Depending on the item you can also use Shrink/Grow to get a close approximation, though that won\u2019t change the object\u2019s weight.<br /> <br /> If you can get the ghost of a bag and its anchor you can transfer things to Twilight, put it in the bag, and drag the bag around via its anchor. Then you can just grab stuff out of the bag with Touch of the Grave.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T15:54:42-08:00","id":1160029,"title":"","content":"Space is definitely the best bet since you can enlarge spaces with it.<br /> <br /> \u200b<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2632\" data-vbnamecard=\"2632\">Mrmdubois</a>: That comes with the assumption that ghost objects have Anchors in the first place. I don't think that's the case, but I can't find anything explicit to back that up right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T15:58:38-08:00","id":1160031,"title":"","content":"So, is the spell &quot;Secret Room&quot; (Space 4-dot) what the OP is looking for? Can there be a weaker spell for a smaller volume?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/22570-fallenstar","name":"FallenStar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T21:42:08-08:00","id":1160118,"title":"","content":"Does it need to be a pocket dimension? With Matter 3 you could shrink the sword, turn it into a ring, keep it on your person in an inconspicuous way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-18T04:14:00-08:00","id":1160167,"title":"","content":"Remember Matter 2 can be used to make an object undetectable, which while not exactly what the OP is asking for, achieves a lot of the same goals. As for placing an object in twilight, I would think using a Ghost Gate via Death 3 would do the trick. But broken objects do appear in ghostly twilight naturally sometimes, so talk to your GM and perhaps suggest that an object could be ritualistically broken (perhaps an Int+Occult) check in way that insures this happens?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6230-katana1515","name":"Katana1515","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-18T05:40:20-08:00","id":1160179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1160026-spells-for-magically-storing-items?p=1160029#post1160029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200b<span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span>: That comes with the assumption that ghost objects have Anchors in the first place. I don't think that's the case, but I can't find anything explicit to back that up right now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Take the anchor of a ghost then and employ it as your porter and/or familiar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-18T06:44:48-08:00","id":1160192,"title":"","content":"Yeah. A Rank 1 Ghost Familiar porter sounds pretty cool. Only 2 merit dots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1470-johnny-awesome","name":"Johnny Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1470_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"447"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-18T07:19:03-08:00","id":1160201,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Johnny Awesome</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1160026-spells-for-magically-storing-items?p=1160192#post1160192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah. A Rank 1 Ghost Familiar porter sounds pretty cool. Only 2 merit dots.</div> </div> </div> </div>Give them an Imbued Item with Ghost Gate and name them Jeeves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-19T15:18:10-08:00","id":1160663,"title":"","content":"You could do something with just space three Co-locate.You keep all your stuff in a special room you set up. Leave something with a strong sympathetic connection to you in the room and then when you want something just overlap the areas and grab it. It will look like you pulled them out of thin air.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13691-margul","name":"Margul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-26T01:37:52-08:00","id":1162659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Margul</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1160026-spells-for-magically-storing-items?p=1160663#post1160663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You could do something with just space three Co-locate.You keep all your stuff in a special room you set up. Leave something with a strong sympathetic connection to you in the room and then when you want something just overlap the areas and grab it. It will look like you pulled them out of thin air.</div> </div> </div> </div>just as you're at it, you could leave your Soulstone<br /> 1) it'd make a nice Demesne<br /> 2) all that shiny metal (I expect it to become a majestic armory) could make an awesome stygian\\matter aligned yantra<br /> 3) perfect sympatetic connection<br /> 4) strong security since your soulstone would trigger your peripheric mage sight<br /> 5) oh, the danger of this","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1djeav1YTEwQq1fkDtWEKh7PPVFmzj3y-\" target=\"_blank\">The Repository</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13158-sir-bardiel","name":"Sir Bardiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13158_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}